summary:
  The pipe to ffmpeg has a buffer of this side's own.

history:
  ffmpeg leaves when it has its seconds, and a station never ends: what the
  buffer still held could not be written out, and every reading of a real
  station ended in a traceback on stderr.

target:
  package/contents/ui/loudness.py

find:
              bufsize=0,

replace:
              bufsize=-1,

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_loudness.py::test_a_stream_that_goes_on_past_the_reading_is_left_without_a_word.
  Line-neutral.
